# A file dialog (Windows' Open or Save) in front (decision 181): the island
# hangs under it, a double-click on the pill opens the card that picks files,
# and that card closes when the dialog goes.
# Default tokens: idle pill 160 wide, compact 260. A 1000-wide screen.

scenario: by a file dialog the pill opens with a double-click, on the picking card
screen 1000
panel timer
panel search picker
picker 300                          -> Idle picking=under
click                               -> Idle                    # one click isn't enough
double-click                        -> Expanded expanded=search
picker-gone                         -> Idle picking=no         # nothing left to give a file to

scenario: without a dialog a double-click is just its clicks
panel timer
panel search picker
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer
double-click                        -> Expanded expanded=timer

scenario: the island hangs centred under the dialog, and goes back to its own spot
screen 1000
restore left
picker 300                          -> pill=220 spot=left      # the idle pill, 160 wide, centred on 300
picker 600                          -> pill=520                # the dialog moved
picker                              -> pill=0 picking=yes      # no room under it: its own place, still picking
picker 300
picker-gone                         -> pill=0 spot=left

scenario: under a dialog at the screen's edge the pill stays on the screen
screen 1000
picker 990                          -> pill=840

scenario: an activity's pill waits for the double-click too, and so does the bubble
panel search picker
start a
picker 400
click                               -> Compact
start b
bubble                              -> Split
double-click                        -> Expanded expanded=search

scenario: an alert and an open card take a click as ever
panel search picker
start a
picker 400
alert ping
click                               -> Expanded expanded=a
click                               -> Compact

scenario: a card that was open stays; only the picking card goes with the dialog
panel timer keep
panel search picker
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer
picker 400                          -> Expanded expanded=timer
picker-gone                         -> Expanded expanded=timer
card search
picker 400
picker-gone                         -> Idle                    # opened before the dialog or not

scenario: with no picking card a double-click does nothing
panel timer
picker 400
double-click                        -> Idle

scenario: by a file dialog the island can't be lifted, and a lifted one lands
screen 1000
hold
wait 400                            -> lifted=yes
picker 300                          -> lifted=no picking=under
hold
wait 400                            -> lifted=no
picker-gone
hold
wait 400                            -> lifted=yes
